	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"人とAIの“すれ違い”をテーマに挑む新規SFプロジェクト『SYNDUALITY』が本格始動！",
			"2023年放送開始予定のTVアニメ『SYNDUALITY』から、物語の鍵を握るメイガス「ノワール」がFigure-rise Standardで最速立体化！",
			"■印象的なジャケットは着脱が可能。ハンドパーツの選択により袖から手をのぞかせるこだわりのポーズも劇中さながらに演出。",
			"■表情パーツが3種付属し、タンポ印刷・水転写式デカールによりキャラクターの表情を繊細に表現。",
			"■各部の関節は自然なシルエットを意識しつつ、可動域を確保。",
			"■ディスプレイの自由度を向上させるプラモデルオリジナルのジョイントパーツや台座が付属。"
		],
		"en": [
			"The impressive jacket can be put on and taken off. By selecting hand parts, the pose that peeks out of the sleeve is also directed as in the play.",
			"Three types of facial expression parts are included, and the character's facial expressions are delicately expressed by tampo printing and water transfer decals.",
			"The joints of each part are conscious of the natural silhouette while ensuring a range of motion.",
			"Comes with plastic model original joint parts and pedestals that improve the degree of freedom of display.[Accessories]",
			"3 types × face parts",
			"1 set × hand parts",
			"Display Joint Parts × 1",
			"Display pedestal× 1",
			"Water transfer type decal × 1"
		]
	},
